  "title": "ee.evidence.withdraw_session.v1",
  "description": "Metadata-only receipt for ee evidence withdraw --session. Withdraws currently retained CASS sources atomically; does not disable future imports. Other producers and original source bytes are retained. Queued means index publication is pending.",
